  "description": "Some marry for love, and some marry for convenience. In I-Jae’s case, she marries Yu-Heon, the son of a business tycoon, to save her family after her father ends up in deep debt. Even though their marriage is contractual, I-Jae feels an intense attraction for the cold and calculating Yu-Heon. Every night in her dreams, she imagines what it would be like to make love with him… until one day, the two end up actually sharing a passionate night together. But will their physical chemistry be enough to build a genuine connection? Or will I-Jae remain a pawn in Yu-Heon’s game?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
